@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p>
        Use this page to detail your site's privacy policy. Describe what data you
        collect from users, why you collect it, how long you keep it, and what
        rights users have over their data.
    </p>
    <p>
        At minimum, a privacy policy should cover: (1) the categories of personal
        information collected, (2) the business purpose for collecting it, (3)
        third parties with whom it is shared, (4) how long it is retained, and
        (5) how users can request access, correction or deletion of their data.
    </p>
</div>